, MCU, sensors, control"}],[{"text":"Industrial"},{"text":"MCU, PLC, Modbus, CAN, Ethernet"}],[{"text":"Medical Devices"},{"text":"Embedded C, RTOS, validation, quality"}],[{"text":"Aerospace/Defense"},{"text":"C/C++, RTOS, real-time systems, reliability"}],[{"text":"Smart Appliances"},{"text":"MCU, sensors, connectivity"}],[{"text":"Electronics Manufacturing"},{"text":"Hardware testing, firmware, validation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Certifications & Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should supplement projects rather than replace practical experience."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Embedded"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embedded C"},{"text":"ARM Cortex-M"},{"text":"STM32"},{"text":"FreeRTOS"},{"text":"Embedded Linux"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Electronics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital electronics"},{"text":"Microcontrollers"},{"text":"PCB design"},{"text":"Electronics instrumentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"GDB"},{"text":"CMake"},{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink where relevant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"IoT"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MQTT"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Cloud IoT concepts"},{"text":"Device security"},{"text":"A strong GitHub portfolio is often more useful for entry-level embedded hiring than collecting many unrelated certificates."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"p","text":"After B.Sc Electronics, suitable PG pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"MSc"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Electronics"},{"text":"MSc Electronics & Instrumentation"},{"text":"MSc Embedded Systems"},{"text":"MSc Electronics & Communication-related programs where eligible"},{"text":"MSc IoT"},{"text":"MSc Computer Science"},{"text":"MSc Applied Electronics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Programs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embedded Systems"},{"text":"Embedded & Real-Time Systems"},{"text":"VLSI"},{"tex